# --- Repo hygiene: keep model artifacts out of the root ---
# Prediction arrays and GPU/CPU result JSONs are canonical ONLY under results/.
# These anchored root patterns stop stray copies (e.g. files pasted or
# re-downloaded into the repo root) from ever being committed.
/*.npz
/colab_transformer_gpu_results*.json
/gpu_metrics_recomputed*.json
/frozen_split_reconciled*.json
/st8_regime_reconciled*.json
/st6_st7_reconciled*.json
/cpu_energy_measured*.json

# Browser re-download duplicates, e.g. "results (1).json", "preds (2).npz"
* (1).*
* (2).*
* (3).*
* - Copy.*
